      "review_description": "Electrical Masters recently designed and installed a new solar battery system for me and decommissioned my old system, and I couldn’t be happier with the entire experience.  From start to finish, their team was friendly, professional, polite, and incredibly supportive. They were always on time and remained patient and understanding- even when my neglected, overly messy garage caused delays on my end.I worked with Jay Lakota and one of my biggest reliefs was how he and his team handled all the government forms and paperwork it was an absolute godsend and took a huge weight of my shoulders.Having first commissioned solar in 2010 - a process that was a complete nightmare - I am beyond grateful that I chose Electrical Masters this time round. The difference in quality, communication and care was night and day.  I highly recommend them to anyone looking for a trustworthy and capable team for their solar needs.",
