      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "If you’re reading this review because you’re considering the services of Electrical Masters, then my opinion is that you would definitely be impressed with what this company offers.I recently decided to purchase a storage battery and whilst I knew the basics, there was a lot that I didn’t know but wanted to be informed about. I’d previously used SolarQuotes for my Solar panels and that was a good experience, so was confident that they would be able to refer me to 3 trustworthy retailers – an important consideration given that there will be plenty of cowboys with inferior products out there trying to take advantage of the Government Battery Rebate Scheme.Referral led me to Electrical Masters who responded within hours of me requesting a quote. First contact was from Jas who explained the whole process, went into depth on what the various batteries are capable of, asked me what we wanted to achieve and what our goals were. Importantly, through his explanations he was able to provoke questions from me that consequently gave me a great understanding of the product and process, including the finer details of location of unit and installation. Being better informed and between Jas and I, we were able to decide on what the best option would be for us. Jas’ knowledge of their products and his ability to communicate and empathise were first class and gave me the confidence to know I was dealing with the right people. I was given a very competitive quote on the day and after speaking with the other Retailers was very comfortable with my decision to go with Electrical Masters.Following on from this, I received a site visit from Ricky, the company owner, to discuss Battery location – I’d had a possible change of thought. After discussion location was decided on. Through additional discussion, I was extremely impressed with Ricky’s attitude to his business, staff and products, which again reinforced my confidence that I’d made the right decision.Installation time was arranged very quickly (timing is everything!) and Installers Jaswinder and Harry arrived on site as expected and did excellent installation job, cleaned up and removed all packaging and mess. The boys were very friendly, ensured the system was up and running and connected to both Manufacturer’s and my Home’s Networks. They took the time to show me how the App works and whilst I’m still getting a handle on my battery’s capabilities, confidence is growing within days.I purchased a Sigenergy SigenStor  24kWh Battery and highly recommend it and Electrical Masters the Supplier.",
