      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I couldn't be happier with our recent solar and battery installation from Electrical Masters. The entire process was seamless, professional, and delivered exceptional results.A huge shout-out to the installation team:Daniel & Team did an amazing job installing the panels. He ensured we achieved the maximum possible installation on the roof space, which is already translating into fantastic performance. His work ethic and attention to detail were first-rate.Beau's professionalism was outstanding during the installation of the battery and gateway. His neatness, knowledge, and dedication to ensuring everything was commissioned perfectly was truly impressive.It's clear that the Electrical Masters team takes great pride in their work. Highly recommend them for a top-quality system and a stress-free installation!",
