      "review_description": "Electrical Masters provided a well designed battery solution including a gateway to allow full operation of the system in off-grid mode.The quote provided was signficantly cheaper then others for exactly the same equipment.There was a reasonable delay between deposit and installation but this was due to supply of battery components rather than installers.The installers were on time and the installation was very neat and the site was left tidy afterwards. Intially there was a compatibility issue between the existing soalr panel inverter (SolarEdge) and the new battery system (SigEnergy). Electrical Masters spoke to both technical teams and were able to resolve the issue within 48 hours. The SigEnergy app is brilliant and gives your full visibility and control over the system operation.I'd highly recommend Electrical Masters as a battery system installer.",
